  "title": "Sausage Crusted Quiche with Hash Browns",
  "description": "This cheese-y quiche, baked on a bed of hash browns with a sausage &#39;crust,&#39; would be perfect for brunch.",
  "authors": [
    "From the Kitchen at Johnsonville Sausage"
  ],
